author: "harness:claude-code"
close_reason: Registered the preflight through ScopedPreflightOverrideDefinition with commands set to todos import and removed the now-unreachable runtime command guard. Added a smoke test asserting the exact declared ownership array; verified it FAILS when the registration is reverted to the bare-callback form and passes with the fix. Full suite 138 pass 0 fail; coverage gate met at 69.53 lines 85.44 branches 74.29 functions.
body: ""
